  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the ground pork and cook until browned, breaking it up into small pieces as it cooks.",
    "Add the tomato paste, fish sauce, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the chopped bok choi to the skillet and cook until wilted.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a salt block vessel.",
    "Serve the kaldereta hot, garnished with additional bok choi if desired."
